{"id":"0022091441242a73","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst.md","title":"LInst","display":"LInst","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LInst","parameters":["c","s","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LInst"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>s</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>删除一个绑定并替入 s；命中指标 c 时插入 shift(0,c,s)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LInst c s t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z939 (@ LInstProof c s t u z939))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cb92e6b9dd8b4f35\" href=\"?note=cb92e6b9dd8b4f35\" title=\"ZFC_LInstProof\">LInstProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ LInst c s t u)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_LInstProof","status":"resolved","id":"cb92e6b9dd8b4f35","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_LInstProof|LInstProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":778,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6421ddd1ab65a55","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst|LInst]]"},{"id":"a3f9c2d6ae5981df","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LDown|LDown]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LOcc|LOcc]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"6f27b432220e68a8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"f49dd53963cf9324","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"1b2e9f6ae1c2ae24","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_LInst|LInst]]"},{"id":"c76920a4aa016144","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst|LInst]]"},{"id":"9a2945bc56d78cc0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst|LInst]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","cb92e6b9dd8b4f35","593f9bdab4d60707"]}